# Jira Integration - Cursor Development Rules

## 🔐 CORE PRINCIPLES

**SERVER-SIDE ONLY**: Jira credentials MUST NEVER reach client components  
**WEBHOOK VALIDATION**: Always validate webhook payloads with secrets
**RATE LIMITING**: Respect Jira API rate limits and implement backoff

## 📋 SECRET STRUCTURE

### Required AWS Secrets Manager Keys
```json
{
  "JIRA_API_TOKEN": "your-jira-personal-access-token",
