## ⚡ VALIDATION CHECKLIST

When working with Jira:

- [ ] API token properly configured in AWS Secrets Manager
- [ ] Base URL includes full domain (https://company.atlassian.net)
- [ ] Server-side only (no client-side access)
- [ ] Webhook signature validation implemented
- [ ] Rate limiting and retry logic in place
- [ ] Safe error logging (no token exposure)
- [ ] Input validation for user-provided data
- [ ] Proper JQL injection protection 